  "note": "The v = 2 case is formalized with the same constant on the book's extended range S ≥ 16; the v = 1 bound 0.36393 is not formalized and not used. Erratum: In the proof of (5.31) the term from |g_v(x)| <= ... + c_{v,5}/sqrt(x) (x >= 10^10) is printed and used as (2-sqrt2)c_{v,5}/10^5 for both v; for v = 1 the sum over all s < S/10^10 makes it 2(2-sqrt2)c_{1,5}/10^5, so the printed 0.0006506 should be 0.0006513 and the v = 1 total is 0.3639231 (not 0.3639225), still <= 0.36393. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_5_31.py`)."
